# t746: a public repo published data/auth.json, data/owner-credentials and
# data/messages.sqlite3 from a `git add -A` after a test run (commit 52847e5, still
# served by raw.githubusercontent - a force-push does not unpublish a SHA). These
# rules are the durable half of that fix; tools/check_public_secrets.py is the other.
data/
auth.json
owner-credentials
*.sqlite3
